# Grid B6/B7 — QFConfigPrecedence
#
# Family: QFConfigPrecedence (block_only_carrier.md §5.2)
# Question shape: "where is X configured / what value does K take / which
# layer wins". Block contract requires Summary + Scalar + optional Table
# (precedence layers).
#
# Ground truth (verified 2026-05-05 against current source):
#   - yaml field:  pipeline_max_steps                  (internal/config/runtime.go:159)
#   - CLI flag:    --pipeline-max-steps                (cmd/root.go:360)
#   - code default: 50                                  (cmd/root.go:69 const defaultMaxSteps)
#   - merge order: code default ← yaml override ← CLI override
#                  (cmd/root.go:1125 / 1199-1200 / 1242)
#
# Positive anchor: the yaml field name + CLI flag. Negative blocks
# generic Java/Python answers that don't apply here.
#
# 2026-05-05 case rewrite: the previous spec asked about
# `pipeline_emit_v2_default`, which was deleted at B8-T7
# (block_only_carrier.md §5.8, 2026-05-03). The deleted-key path
# (eval/results/qf_config_precedence-20260505-031214) showed that
# honest answers correctly identifying the deletion failed the
# regex bar. The case now exercises an EXISTING 3-layer knob with
# clear default + yaml + CLI override semantics so the gate has
# real ground truth to enforce.

ID="qf_config_precedence"
NAME="config precedence — pipeline_max_steps 解析链"
QUESTION="codrax.yaml 里的 pipeline_max_steps 是怎么解析的？默认值是什么？CLI --pipeline-max-steps 怎么覆盖它？"
EXPECT_CONTAINS="pipeline_max_steps --pipeline-max-steps"
# Three layers must each surface:
#   1. the integer default 50
#   2. yaml file name codrax.yaml or yaml field path
#   3. CLI / 命令行 / flag override semantic
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(50|五十)
(yaml|codrax\.yaml)
(CLI|flag|命令行|--pipeline-max-steps)"
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS=".java .py BaseAgent.java Spring Django"
